From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] notepad: View > Spell check; unsaved work kept over a close

Spell check (View): words the system's hunspell dictionary does not know
get a red wavy line. Closing the window keeps changed tabs' text under
%LOCALAPPDATA%\Stained Glass\Notepad\Unsaved and brings them back, still
unsaved, at the next start, as Windows 11's Notepad does (with "Restore
previous session" on). Field report 2026-10-17.
---
